"percent=22.5)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api.rst:526
msgid ""
"UNIX typically reserves 5% of disk space for root. :field:`total` and :field:"
"`used` refer to overall space, while :field:`free` and :field:`percent` "
"reflect unprivileged user usage. As a result, :field:`percent` may appear "
"~5% higher than expected. All values match the ``df`` command line utility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api.rst:534
msgid ":field:`percent` value takes root reserved space into account."
msgstr ""

